Date: Tue, 5 May 2026 11:08:12 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Filter MMS/SMS queries by subscription ID

This change modifies MmsSmsProvider to filter results based on the subscription IDs associated with the current user. Queries for conversations, search suggestions, and search results will now return an empty cursor if no subscriptions are available for the user. Otherwise, the queries are augmented with a subId clause to restrict results to messages belonging to the user's subscriptions.

Bug: 418776187
Test: atest
Manual Test: b/510423582
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX

Change-Id: I64fa9a2e334f97f7d6a9c5e62edff73f8e7294c1
Merged-In: I64fa9a2e334f97f7d6a9c5e62edff73f8e7294c1
